      </div>

      <div class="tip-box">
        <h3>Pro Scheduling Tip for Business Executives</h3>
        <p>
          If you are scheduling cross-atlantic meetings between Chicago and European commercial hubs like <a href="/paris-time/">Paris</a> or <a href="/berlin-time/">Berlin</a>, schedule call windows between <strong>8:00 AM and 10:30 AM Chicago time</strong>. This allows teams in Europe to join during their standard afternoon working hours (3:00 PM – 5:30 PM CET).
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

